"""Backend authority for validated Hyprland monitor transactions.

Mode, bitdepth, forced HDR, and global Automatic HDR use explicit-confirmation
Safe Apply; a Mode change includes configured Scale auto. Explicit numeric
Scale changes persist immediately after validation. Transaction,
readback, rollback, journal,
prospective-verifier, and persistence primitives remain independently testable
so the UI can remain a later client.
"""

